menu "GDO diagnostics"
    config GDO_WEB_OTA
        bool "Enable authenticated, signed web firmware updates"
        depends on SECURE_SIGNED_ON_UPDATE
        default n
        help
            Requires ESP-IDF app signature verification. All firmware operations
            also require the device's diagnostics token, printed on the local
            serial console after Wi-Fi connects. No eFuse changes are required
            when using 'Require signed app images' without hardware Secure Boot.
endmenu
